    "-- Temporary Move Deleter --\p" 

    "Get rid of your moves and put them\n"
    "back whenever you want.\p"

    "However, the move deleter cannot be\n"
    "used to regain a move's PP.\p"

    "A restored move will get:\n"
    "a) the PP amount it had when deleted.\l"
    "b) 0 PP if all other moves have 0 PP."
}

